Keep the file shown for the desktop to read

Nothing outside inlyne could tell which file it shows: its command line
goes stale once a link opens another file in place, and its title names
the file from its repository. It now keeps the file it shows, with its
process, in inlyne/showing/<pid> under the state home, from the start
and on each new page but its keys page, and removes it as it quits.

